","text":" (Origami’s magnification\/pinch input)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" nodes that flip the shape between its base and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard."}],"title":"Interaction_PinchView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","role":"collection","type":"topic"}}}